In the afternoon, I am working on my laptop.
Sven comes to my desk.
"Hello Maya, do you have a moment?" he asks.
"Sure, what is it?" I ask.
"I have tested the new feature," he says.
"But I have found a small bug."
"What happened?" I ask him.
"I clicked on the button," Sven explains.
"And then, unfortunately, nothing happened."
I look at my screen immediately.
I read my code again very carefully.
"Ah, a line is missing there!" I call out.
"You saw that really well," I say.
"As a tester I spot something like that right away," he laughs.
I fix the bug right away.
"There, I have corrected the code," I say.
Sven nods at me.
We are really already a very good team.
